  m_text: "Every spell (statement) must end with a semicolon ; \u2013 This marks
    the completion of a command.\n\nSpacing and indentation make spells readable
    \u2013 Though the system ignores spaces, organizing code makes it easier to understand.\n\nC#
    is case-sensitive \u2013 MyClass and myclass are two different spells."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0aae22f55f1cf54c8768d2a8854e9ad, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -5731986960139758937, guid: b0aae22f55f1cf54c8768d2a8854e9ad, type: 2}
